Package: masscan
Version: 1.3.2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: git, make, clang, libpcap, sed
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/robertdavidgraham/masscan
Description: High-speed TCP port scanner
 Masscan is an Internet-scale port scanner. It can scan the entire
 Internet in under 5 minutes, transmitting 10 million packets per
 second, from a single machine. Usage and output are similar to nmap.
